This distribution contains:
- bin/aienos and share/aienos/wizard/*.om: the installer and the aienos
  command, written in Omega by Drake Stapleton (installer/ in this repository).
- share/aienos/wizard/sha256.om: derived from aien-dev/omega-mv
  om/sha256/sha256-om2.om (Apache-2.0), "export fn" changed to "fn".
- bin/aien-serve-http: built from aien-dev/aien-sovereign-core-mv
  (Apache-2.0, "AIEN Sovereign Core, Copyright 2024-2026 Drake Stapleton and
  AIEN Contributors"), with aien-dev/omega-mv's libomega_gpu.a linked in.

The model is not part of this distribution. The wizard downloads
Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8 from Hugging Face under its own license (Apache-2.0,
see the LICENSE file in the model folder).

NVIDIA, CUDA, cuBLAS and GB10 are trademarks of NVIDIA Corporation. AienOS
uses none of NVIDIA's user-space software; it talks to NVIDIA's kernel driver
through its device files.
